# Who owns which part of the code. Put this file at .github/CODEOWNERS in your project.
# The LAST line that matches a file wins (GitHub's rule). Owners are GitHub users (@name) or teams (@org/team).
*                @your-org/leads
/payments/       @your-org/payments-team
/website/        @your-org/web-team
*.md             @your-org/docs
